Your app owns the picker. Upload its URI through the core SDK, then give the returned media object to the controller.

```typescript
const { media } = await chat.uploadMessageMediaFromUri({
  conversationId,
  uri: asset.uri,
  fileName: asset.fileName ?? 'attachment',
  contentType: asset.mimeType,
